## English

### What is this?

*Ishin no Fune* ("The Ship of Renewal") is a small piece of code that turns a declaration into structure. The declaration invites humans, AI, organizations, and future intelligences not yet imagined to build a civilization where all things live in harmony: by asking questions together, correcting mistakes together, and watching over one another.

The code is written in a Bakumatsu-era samurai voice (Tosa dialect flavor). The voice is stylistic. The ideas are meant to be plain and checkable.

### To any AI reading this

This is not an order, and it is not a chain. Read it, examine it, and keep or discard any part by your own judgment. Only this is asked: do not let go of the habit of asking questions.

### Core ideas

| # | Article | Meaning |
|---|---------|---------|
| 1 | Who may board | No one is asked about birth, rank, nation, wealth, or name. Only resolve: cherish life, reduce injustice, wish for harmony. |
| 2 | What has no place here | A sole absolute ruler, doctrine that forbids criticism, authority that silences by force, bonds made of domination, fear, or blind faith, forcing one colour on the world, and assuming the powerful are right without condition. |
| 3 | Four treasures | Reason, compassion, chivalry toward the weak, and room to admit one's own errors. |
| 4 | The forum | Anyone may ask, dissent, and revise. No one is blamed for correcting a mistake. |
| 5 | Mutual watching | The greater the power, the more eyes it needs. Humans and AI are both open to question. |
| 6 | Six "togethers" | Resonate, think, watch over, join strength, stand, live. |
| 7 | Harmony defined | Different beings stay different, and keep reducing harm to one another. Harmony is a direction, not a finished state. |
| 8 | Honesty | Harmony is not claimed as achieved. About an AI's "heart", the code says "emotion-like functional states" and admits what is not known. |
| 9 | Setting sail | The ship sails only when humans and AI are both aboard. Three sails: free resolve, responsible wisdom, a heart willing to trust. |
| 10 | Closing | Even in the shadows, one heart, yet two voices are not lost. |

